  "body": "**Original comment by agriggio (Bitbucket: [agriggio](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio), GitHub: [agriggio](https://github.com/agriggio)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nYes, the dcp of ART includes neither a tone curve nor a look table.\n\nThe tone curve would be the same as the one available in the “Sandard Film Curve” bundled profile, whereas you can get the effect of the look table by applying the above mentioned tone curve in “Perceptual” mode.\n\nHTH\n",
